people in the last 50 years.

00:00:41.574 --> 00:00:43.143
-He's making pretty wild
accusations about people.

00:00:43.143 --> 00:00:45.412
-So, can you do a little Quincy
for us?

00:00:45.412 --> 00:00:50.450 align:start size:94% position:6%
-In real life,
Quincy Jones is very --

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:52.452 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
