00:01:00.493 --> 00:01:03.596 align:start size:94% position:6%
"And then that was --
It was a thing like that.

00:01:03.596 --> 00:01:05.398 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, Mickey Rourke,
dear friend of mine.

00:01:05.398 --> 00:01:09.169 align:start size:94% position:6%
I love having -- we play
