is Neil deGrasse Tyson.

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:21.948 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, the best.

00:01:21.948 --> 00:01:23.316 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:23.316 --> 00:01:26.553 align:start size:94% position:6%
Look at that vest.
-The vest.

00:01:26.553 --> 00:01:28.455 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-That vest.

00:01:28.455 --> 00:01:31.991 align:start size:94% position:6%
That guy is the best.
