00:01:45.038 --> 00:01:49.709 align:start size:94% position:6%
"The world is not flat.
This is called gravity, okay?"

00:01:49.709 --> 00:01:52.045 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.045 --> 00:01:53.646 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And, hey, buddy,
this is really exciting.

00:01:53.646 --> 00:01:55.648 align:start size:94% position:6%
