00:02:13.833 --> 00:02:16.336 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm so happy to come back,
and I'm so happy you're there.

00:02:16.336 --> 00:02:17.670 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it's just
a delight to have you here.

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:19.873 align:start size:94% position:6%
I love you so much.
-I love you.

